    "group": "Krootox Rampagers",
    "summary": "Whenever this unit finishes a **[Charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move)**, pick 1 enemy unit in **[Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** of this unit. Then:\n\n1. Roll a D6 for each model of this unit in Engagement Range of the picked unit.\n2. Each 4+ deals D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** to the picked unit.\n3. If these mortal wounds destroy any of its models, the picked unit takes a [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock).",
